# Line endings: LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# The sources are JavaScript that the host and the browser bundle both read, and the bundle is a
# committed artifact (`lib/client.js`): a contributor whose git rewrites endings would produce a
# diff of the whole file and a bundle that no longer matches what `--check` computed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.svg text
*.png binary
*.tgz binary
